    "body": "node has https://nodejs.org/api/tty.html#writestreamhascolorscount-env derived from chalk's `supports-color` that got added in node 10. not only would using it would make color detection more accurate, but it also would make the package more in line with node. it would also fix issues like #41.\r\n\r\n`yoctocolors` seems to already use this API by doing [`tty?.WriteStream?.prototype?.hasColors?.() ?? false`](https://github.com/sindresorhus/yoctocolors/blob/v2.1.1/base.js#L6)",
